    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/a5e7b3bade54d2eae07d91c5d574f2f3.poster.avif?t=1752918600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/a5e7b3bade54d2eae07d91c5d574f2f3.webm?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/a5e7b3bade54d2eae07d91c5d574f2f3.mp4?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/deb3cd60617772e7772fa2a9c2c2d36a.avif?t=1752918600\" data-has-big width=800 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends for cooperative gameplay! Work together to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and reach new heights - because everything's more fun together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/456c9a6e1302c2a6fad7f422fea71fbf.poster.avif?t=1752918600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/456c9a6e1302c2a6fad7f422fea71fbf.webm?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/456c9a6e1302c2a6fad7f422fea71fbf.mp4?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/e06f7448a9f12f1d374ec215cd65003d.avif?t=1752918600\" data-has-big width=800 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic over-the-shoulder gameplay immerses you in world exploration. The optimal camera angle helps precisely time jumps, discover hidden paths, and enjoy breathtaking vistas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/77e6a81d3d9d2d057cbf6e1af946981a.poster.avif?t=1752918600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/77e6a81d3d9d2d057cbf6e1af946981a.webm?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/77e6a81d3d9d2d057cbf6e1af946981a.mp4?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/ba35d1941e53d23a834dfb0dd816bc4f.avif?t=1752918600\" data-has-big width=800 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter clever puzzles and mechanisms requiring teamwork and wit. Solve them to unlock new areas and gain unexpected abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/2d01ddfa57c6e51ba829d032a3ff3f91.poster.avif?t=1752918600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/2d01ddfa57c6e51ba829d032a3ff3f91.webm?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/2d01ddfa57c6e51ba829d032a3ff3f91.mp4?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/732cf54296933a9a83e424ffb49a176a.avif?t=1752918600\" data-has-big width=800 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills through challenging yet rewarding jumps, climbs, and balancing acts. Every move matters - one wrong step means starting over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/52f08796ad44c567ca5f159f5263fbe2.poster.avif?t=1752918600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/52f08796ad44c567ca5f159f5263fbe2.webm?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/52f08796ad44c567ca5f159f5263fbe2.mp4?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/23f6276d62892accd6858fe3c4fff1b9.avif?t=1752918600\" data-has-big width=800 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright, friendly art style creates a lighthearted atmosphere without visual clutter. Clean shapes and vibrant colors make the game world expressive and easy on the eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/d8980261d07b4beca72f6792b4bd9328.poster.avif?t=1752918600\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/d8980261d07b4beca72f6792b4bd9328.webm?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/d8980261d07b4beca72f6792b4bd9328.mp4?t=1752918600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/84d1eba31f57d0d5a5c0c7d64f3b4d23.avif?t=1752918600\" data-has-big width=800 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey full of discoveries -</p>",
